<LanguageData>
  <!-- Psionic Augmentation -->
  <!--原中文: '灵能增幅', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Psionic Augmentation',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Psionic Augmentation-->
  <TM_PsionicAugmentation.label>灵能增幅</TM_PsionicAugmentation.label>
  <!--原中文: '灵能是一种以动能或势能的形式表现的精神能量。灵能战士将其引导到全身以加强身体活动。\n  \n一个训练有素的灵能战士能够通过使用灵能和身体完成不可思议的壮举。灵能增幅作为第二天性，在战斗中和战斗之外都能自然发生。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Psionic power is a physical manifestation of mental energy in the form of kinetic or potential energy. A Psionic is able to utilize this power most efficiently by directing it throughout their body to reinforce physical action.
	
A well trained psionic is able to achieve incredible physical feats using a blend of psionic and physical strength. Psionic augmentation becomes second nature and occurs naturally both in and out of combat.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Psionic power is a physical manifestation of mental energy in the form of kinetic or potential energy. A Psionic is able to utilize this power most efficiently by directing it throughout their body to reinforce physical action.
	
A well trained psionic is able to achieve incredible physical feats using a blend of psionic and physical strength. Psionic augmentation becomes second nature and occurs naturally both in and out of combat.-->
  <TM_PsionicAugmentation.description>灵能是一种以动能或势能的形式表现的精神能量。灵能战士将其引导到全身以加强身体活动。\n  \n一个训练有素的灵能战士能够通过使用灵能和身体完成不可思议的壮举。灵能增幅作为第二天性，在战斗中和战斗之外都能自然发生。</TM_PsionicAugmentation.description>
  <!-- Psionic Barrier start -->
  <!--原中文: '心灵屏障', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Psionic Barrier',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Psionic Barrier-->
  <TM_PsionicBarrier.label>心灵屏障</TM_PsionicBarrier.label>
  <!--原中文: '灵能形成一种精神屏障，在使用者周围一小块区域内排斥动能。使用此能力需要持续集中以维持屏障，灵能战士在此激活期间将无法执行任何其他动作。\n  \n此技能需要2点才能升级。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The Psionic forms a psychic barrier that repels kinetic energy in a small area around the user. Using this ability requires constant concentration in order to maintain the barrier and the Psionic will be unable to perform any other action while this is active.

This ability requires 2 points to level.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: The Psionic forms a psychic barrier that repels kinetic energy in a small area around the user. Using this ability requires constant concentration in order to maintain the barrier and the Psionic will be unable to perform any other action while this is active.

This ability requires 2 points to level.-->
  <TM_PsionicBarrier.description>灵能形成一种精神屏障，在使用者周围一小块区域内排斥动能。使用此能力需要持续集中以维持屏障，灵能战士在此激活期间将无法执行任何其他动作。\n  \n此技能需要2点才能升级。</TM_PsionicBarrier.description>
  <!--原中文: '心灵屏障', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Psionic Barrier',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Psionic Barrier-->
  <TM_PsionicBarrier_Projected.label>心灵屏障</TM_PsionicBarrier_Projected.label>
  <!--原中文: '灵能形成一种精神屏障，在使用者周围一小块区域内排斥动能。使用此能力需要持续集中以维持屏障，灵能战士在此激活期间将无法执行任何其他动作。\n  \n心灵屏障可以投射到指定的位置。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The Psionic forms a psychic barrier that repels kinetic energy in a small area around the user. Using this ability requires constant concentration in order to maintain the barrier and the Psionic will be unable to perform any other action while this is active.

This barrier can be projected to a designation location.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: The Psionic forms a psychic barrier that repels kinetic energy in a small area around the user. Using this ability requires constant concentration in order to maintain the barrier and the Psionic will be unable to perform any other action while this is active.

This barrier can be projected to a designation location.-->
  <TM_PsionicBarrier_Projected.description>灵能形成一种精神屏障，在使用者周围一小块区域内排斥动能。使用此能力需要持续集中以维持屏障，灵能战士在此激活期间将无法执行任何其他动作。\n  \n心灵屏障可以投射到指定的位置。</TM_PsionicBarrier_Projected.description>
