  <!-- Psionic Dash start -->
  <!--原中文: '灵能跃进', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Psionic Dash',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Psionic Dash-->
  <TM_PsionicDash.label>灵能跃进</TM_PsionicDash.label>
  <!--原中文: '向他们的身体注入大量的灵能，推动自己快速爆发运动。每一步都会发出能量冲击波。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The Psionic infuses their body with an overwhelming amount of energy and uses it to propel themselves in a rapid burst of movement. Each step emits shockwaves of energy.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: The Psionic infuses their body with an overwhelming amount of energy and uses it to propel themselves in a rapid burst of movement. Each step emits shockwaves of energy.-->
  <TM_PsionicDash.description>向他们的身体注入大量的灵能，推动自己快速爆发运动。每一步都会发出能量冲击波。</TM_PsionicDash.description>
  <!-- PsionicStorm -->
  <!--原中文: '灵能风暴', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Psionic Storm',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Psionic Storm-->
  <TM_PsionicStorm.label>灵能风暴</TM_PsionicStorm.label>
  <!--原中文: '灵能战士解除所有精神障碍，释放出无限的灵能冲击。灵能战士将消耗大量能量，并在攻击后一段时间内处于脆弱状态，无法施展灵能。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The Psionic lets down all mental barriers and unleashes their unrestrained psionic power. Due to the nature of this attack, the psionic will expend a tremendous amount of energy and will be left vulnerable, unable to exert psionic power, for a period following the attack.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: The Psionic lets down all mental barriers and unleashes their unrestrained psionic power. Due to the nature of this attack, the psionic will expend a tremendous amount of energy and will be left vulnerable, unable to exert psionic power, for a period following the attack.-->
  <TM_PsionicStorm.description>灵能战士解除所有精神障碍，释放出无限的灵能冲击。灵能战士将消耗大量能量，并在攻击后一段时间内处于脆弱状态，无法施展灵能。</TM_PsionicStorm.description>
